#
# --- node_modules vendored inside nodejs_wheel (circuit-server) ------------
# The upstream agent-server ships Node.js via the nodejs_wheel package; its
# bundled node_modules tree pins npm's own vendored dependencies (tar,
# undici, brace-expansion, handlebars, minimatch, shell-quote, ...). These
# are upstream release artifacts we cannot rebuild; they clear when the
# SDK/nodejs_wheel pins move. Same deferral as the .venv findings.
